 Client for `inventory-api`. Every function takes a `transport`,
 `async (request) => response`, so callers choose HTTP, IPC or a fake.
 
-- `listItems(transport)` → every item, ordered by `id`.
+- `listItems(transport)` → every item, ordered by `id`. `GET /items` returns
+  one page at a time, so this makes one request per page: it sends no cursor
+  first, then passes each `next_cursor` back unchanged until it is `null`.
+  It rejects if a page has no `items` array, a `next_cursor` is not a string,
+  or a cursor repeats.
 - `getItem(transport, id)` → one item; rejects on any non-200 response.
 - `lowStock(items, threshold)` → SKUs with `qty` below the threshold.
 
